\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 Hello Grace.\par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 \par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 I hope you are enjoying being in your new house in the west end.  It is nice to have your Mum, Dad and Yourself nearby. It means we can all go for breakfast one morning or have a nice Chinese meal at night.  It is also close to the comic store.\par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 \par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 When you have finished reading the Spider-Man books we can go and get some more for you to read.  I am looking forward to seeing the great poses you will get out of the Spider-Man figures. I have treated myself to some new ones. I have a Ben Reilly Spider-Man, a Kaine Spider-Man and a new Thor figure.\par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 \par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 I am enjoying my new job and have been collecting figures myself again. I used to write letters home to Natasha and my Mum and Dad when I lived in the USA. I am writing this on a word processor I developed myself for an old computer. The computer is 36 years old. Very old but I have been enjoying developing this for it! I am using this letter to help test it!\par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 \par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 My current computer developed a fault and I have ordered a new one to replace it. I'm looking forward to seeing you all at some point when you have settled into the new place. If this letter looks a little bit rough it means the word processor has some bugs in it!\par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 \par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 Are you looking forward to going to school next year? I hope you have a great time at school and do well. I'm sure you will :)\par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 Kind regards,\par
\pard\ql\ltrpar \plain\f9\fs36\cf1 Your Uncle Frank.\par
}
